  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Verso.LocalizedText
  sourcePt: "<size=96><b>VERSO</b></size>\n\n\n<color=#FFB347><b>Cria\xE7\xE3o, arte e programa\xE7\xE3o</b></color>\nLaryssa Aguiar Menjon\n\n<color=#FFB347><b>M\xFAsica</b></color>\nHAI Soundworks\nhaisoundworks.com\n\n<color=#FFB347><b>Efeitos sonoros (Pixabay)</b></color>\nPulo \xB7 Aryan Raikundalia\nAlma \xB7 Universfield\nChave \xB7 Xmer\u2122\nPassou de fase \xB7 CRYUG CEET\nFim de jogo \xB7 Hanifi \u015Eahin\nClique \xB7 666HeroHero\nHover \xB7 u_uev3l0tolc\n\n<color=#FFB347><b>C\xE9u</b></color>\nPSX Sky Sampler \xB7 Munchkin Gaming\n\n<color=#FFB347><b>Vozes</b></color>\nElevenLabs\n\n<color=#FFB347><b>Fontes</b></color>\nLilita One e Fredoka\nSIL Open Font License\n\n\n<b>Obrigada por jogar!</b>"
